  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Water&nbsp;gas is produced by the reaction of&nbsp;hot coke with blast of steam.</p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> (Water gas or Syn gas);</p><p>Water gas is also called syn gas because it is used for synthesis of methanol.</p>"
